  "notes": "Warm parchment/ledger aesthetic: cream panels on a beige page, dark espresso top bar, serif headings evoking an old campaign ledger and monospace hex coordinates. Hex map uses muted terrain fills with hatched patterns for rumored/unknown hexes, dark-red solid polyline for route A and blue dashed polyline for route B, with numbered circular step markers. Selected hex gets a blue hex outline and the matching route row a pale blue fill. Party members are colour-coded letter avatars (P/S/K/L) reused as per-hex knowledge chips. Includes DM-only secret callouts (tan inset), numeric ± steppers for forage and prep time budget, a 12-cell day strip showing rain/after-rations hatching, and a 7-day weather forecast strip. Interactions verified live: route tabs swap all route data and map emphasis; clicking hexes or rows syncs map, inspector and prep list."
